{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q27292509","formula":"C₂₈H₅₃N₇O₈","hill":"C28H53N7O8","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":28.0,"H":53.0,"N":7.0,"O":8.0},"names":{"en":"Hexapeptide-10"},"descriptions":{"en":"Hexapeptide-10 (SIKVAV, Serilesine) is a hexapeptide that is composed of a sequence Ser-Ile-Lys-Val-Ala-Val found at the C-terminus of the laminin α1 chain. Unlike other matrikine peptides which primarily act in the epidermis, hexapeptide-10 is active in deeper skin layers and promotes synthesis of laminin and integrin proteins, increases secretion of matrix metalloproteinases MMP2 and MMP9, and has angiogenic effects. Hexapeptide-10 promotes wound healing and tissue remodeling, and is used in skincare products with purported anti-aging effects."},"fame":1,"pubchemCid":10145673,"mass":615.8,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC[C@H](C)[C@@H](C(=O)N[C@@H](CCCCN)C(=O)N[C@@H](C(C)C)C(=O)N[C@@H](C)C(=O)N[C@@H](C(C)C)C(=O)O)NC(=O)[C@H](CO)N","inchikey":"OFGVZFQUFJYSGS-CPDXTSBQSA-N","iupac":"(2S)-2-[[(2S)-2-[[(2S)-2-[[(2S)-6-amino-2-[[(2S,3S)-2-[[(2S)-2-amino-3-hydroxypropanoyl]amino]-3-methylpentanoyl]amino]hexanoyl]amino]-3-methylbutanoyl]amino]propanoyl]amino]-3-methylbutanoic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"10145673","atoms":96,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-3.945,"y":-2.961,"z":4.019,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.053,"y":-3.283,"z":3.027,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.408,"y":-2.121,"z":2.073,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.608,"y":-2.526,"z":1.202,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.213,"y":-1.574,"z":1.245,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.635,"y":-2.567,"z":0.198,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.899,"y":-3.766,"z":0.183,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.684,"y":-2.025,"z":-0.64,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.94,"y":-2.827,"z":-1.608,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.792,"y":-3.241,"z":-2.822,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.66,"y":-2.148,"z":-3.462,"el":"C"},{"x":